## examples

### Example 1: Create Order Controller
```
/command create-controller Order
```
Creates: orders.controller.js, orders.routes.js, orders.validator.js

### Example 2: Create Customer Controller (no validation)
```
/command create-controller Customer --includeValidation=false
```
Creates: customers.controller.js, customers.routes.js

### Example 3: Create Public API Controller
```
/command create-controller ServiceCategory --includeAuth=false
```
Creates: service-categories.controller.js (with public access)
